emulated NetWare volume. (Every directory can become a volume). For
me this process took over an hour, and the DOS prompt doesn't come back
before it's finished. Trying to use the printer server restulted in
kernel panics and crash dumps !
If you work in a WfW, Win95, WinNT environment I can recommend samba.
Samba make your Alpha Server behave like a MS Network server. It was 
easy to install and works without problems, and... it's free !
Hope this helps
