>Dear colleagues!
>I'd like to use Multia's (VX-40F2) embedded Sound System in my applications
>which work under  Digital-Unix and Linux. That's why I'm interested in
>the following:
>- Are there anywhere source texts of Multia_Windows_Sound_System driver?
>- Has anybody tried tested this Sound_Sys. under any Unix?
