really want the Altavista indexer or search engine you have to plow through
the unrelated products with similar names just to find it.  I think we're
looking at a textbook case of brand name dilution - that is, stamping the
same name on everything such that the original brand name loses all value
and meaning.  The party or parties that made this decision should be 
presented at the next DECUS - and the audience treated to a couple of cases 
