|>I am trying to install NT Server (3.51) on a Starion 300i w/32 Megs RAM 
|>and 1275 Meg Seagate IDE HD - for use as a test machine (budgets are not 
|>what they used to be...)
|>
|>However, NT will not recognize the CDROM...(Philips 2x - came with the 
|>Starion) Have tried all the NT CD rom drivers that come on the install 
