Digital never claimed NT support for the Starion series, and the Starion is
not on the NT Hardware Compatibility List.  The issue is, as you found,
the lack of NT drivers for the CD-ROM drive used (as well as the
modem/sound card).  The PC itself can run NT, but you'll have to replace
unsupported components.  With 4X CD-ROMs going for $99 and under, this
should be simple enough.
